# Author attribution — Andrei Pabiarzhyn

When creating or editing **user-facing web pages** (games, landing pages, demos, GitHub Pages sites), always include author attribution unless the user opts out.

## Footer (required)

Fixed footer at bottom of every page/screen, subtle, non-intrusive:

```html
<footer class="site-footer">
  <p>Created by <span class="site-footer__author">Andrei Pabiarzhyn</span></p>
</footer>
```

```css
.site-footer {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 50;
  padding: 8px 16px calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  text-align: center;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.site-footer p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 2vw, 0.85rem);
  font-weight: 600;
  color: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.5);
}

.site-footer__author {
  font-weight: 800;
  color: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.65);
}
```

Adapt colors to match the page background; keep `pointer-events: none` so it never blocks clicks.

## HTML head

```html
<meta name="author" content="Andrei Pabiarzhyn">
```

## Wording

- Default text: **Created by Andrei Pabiarzhyn** (not name alone).
- Do not add links or a sitemap unless requested.
